1. Kofi's program on the TG-1 model, no checks:
  out[1] = 0.00, out[2] = 0.00, sum of all outputs = 0.00
2. The same program with a check after the launch:
  check after launch: cudaErrorInvalidConfiguration
  out[1] = 0.00, out[2] = 0.00, sum of all outputs = 0.00
3. Peek versus get:
  peek: cudaErrorInvalidConfiguration
  peek: cudaErrorInvalidConfiguration
  get:  cudaErrorInvalidConfiguration
  get:  cudaSuccess
4. A kernel without its bounds check (1024 threads, 1000 elements):
  launch:            cudaSuccess
  getLastError:      cudaSuccess
  synchronize:       cudaErrorIllegalAddress
  next copy:         cudaErrorIllegalAddress
  next launch:       cudaErrorIllegalAddress
